   "text": "No public sign-up page.\nAdmin creates employees -> backend calls supabase.auth.admin.inviteUserByEmail()\n-> employee gets an email, sets a password, logs in.\n(This also fixes the 'anyone can register as admin' bug in /api/auth/register.)",
   "originalText": "No public sign-up page.\nAdmin creates employees -> backend calls supabase.auth.admin.inviteUserByEmail()\n-> employee gets an email, sets a password, logs in.\n(This also fixes the 'anyone can register as admin' bug in /api/auth/register.)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "noreg",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
