   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Backend changes needed\n\n1. DATABASE_URL -> Supabase\n   session pooler string\n2. Replace own JWT login with\n   Supabase JWT verification (JWKS)\n3. Read role from\n   app_metadata.role\n4. Uploads -> Supabase Storage\n   (replace local uploads/)\n5. Remove /api/auth/register\n6. CORS: only the Vercel domain\n\n.env: SUPABASE_URL,\nSUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,\nDATABASE_URL, GEMINI_API_KEY",
   "originalText": "Backend changes needed\n\n1. DATABASE_URL -> Supabase\n   session pooler string\n2. Replace own JWT login with\n   Supabase JWT verification (JWKS)\n3. Read role from\n   app_metadata.role\n4. Uploads -> Supabase Storage\n   (replace local uploads/)\n5. Remove /api/auth/register\n6. CORS: only the Vercel domain\n\n.env: SUPABASE_URL,\nSUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,\nDATABASE_URL, GEMINI_API_KEY",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "envs",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
 ],
